  6106.3 * dial c4->gap
  6106.4 ? dial=gap  "Set slide switch 6 LEFT. The system is now operating in the track mode. Notice that the rotary switch oscillates about the object signal. [p.35:] It sweeps past the \"object signal\" until it has lost it and then reverses its direction, returning to the object signal. It again sweeps past, reverses and continues in this fashion until given other instructions or until the object signal is out of range."
  6121.5 * indLamp4 dim->off
