  9854.9 ? dial=gap  "[p.36:] Notice that the rotary switch oscillates about the object signal. If you now move the object signal, the system will continue to search until it finds the new location and will then resume tracking it. [p.35:] It sweeps past the \"object signal\" until it has lost it and then reverses its direction, returning to the object signal. It again sweeps past, reverses and continues in this fashion until given other instructions or until the object signal is out of range."
  9870.0 * indLamp4 dim->off
  9872.3 * outLamp2 dim->off  indLamp3 dim->off
